sequenceDiagram
  participant P0 as Client
  participant P1 as Gateway
  participant P2 as Limiter
  participant P3 as Service
  P0->>P1: Authenticated request
  P1->>P2: Atomic tenant-cost debit
  P2->>P1: Allow or reject
  P1->>P3: Admit within capacity
  P3->>P1: Result or bounded failure
  P1->>P0: 200 or explicit 429 / 503
